# Sound assets

Drop generic, reusable audio files here (and add them to the app target) named to
match `AnimalMaskConfig.soundNames`:

- Donkey (gross-loud): `bray`, `fart`, `burp`
- Raccoon (sneaky): `chitter`, `pounce`
- Pig (gross-messy): `oink`, `splat`, `shake`

Any of `.wav`, `.m4a`, `.caf`, `.aiff`, `.mp3` works. Until you add them, the app
falls back to a system sound so the loop still works during bring-up.

Keep them generic and swappable so families could later add their own.
